   "author_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/97183/fiodor",
   "created_at": "2026-06-12T16:46:56+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>The night sky looks the way it does IRL because of light pollution.<br />\nThere is no lights on in Tarkov so it\u2019s realistic in a way.</p>\n<p>But most of all it\u2019s a matter of personal taste. As someone said before, all the instructions are there if you want to make your own night sky. Or you could just turn down the brightness of one of the existing ones.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
