   "author_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/97183/fiodor",
   "created_at": "2026-06-12T17:49:00+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>I\u2019m sorry if you\u2019re taking this the wrong way.<br />\nI simply mean that you can make your own night sky if you want to or you can turn down the sky brightness of one of those I made.<br />\nI don\u2019t intend to do another one as I made the mod for myself and my friends and I\u2019m satisfied with it.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
